{"id":"erneut","lemma":"erneut","pos":"adj","rank":2149,"glosses":["renewed","repeated"],"ipa":"/ɛʁˈnɔɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/De-erneut.ogg/De-erneut.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Möchtest du es erneut versuchen?","en":"Would you like to try it again?","words":[{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Ich habe erneut verloren.","en":"I lost again.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Lassen Sie es mich erneut versuchen!","en":"Let me try again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390904","words":[{"g":"to allow"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Er wurde erneut zum Bürgermeister gewählt.","en":"He was elected mayor again.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"mayor"},{"g":"chosen, elected"}]},{"text":"Ich danke dir erneut für deine Hilfe!","en":"Thanks again for your help.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"the act of helping"}]}]}